    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Vietnamese\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Vietnamese</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Etymology\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Etymology</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Pronunciation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Pronunciation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Noun\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Noun</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Vietnamese\">Vietnamese</h2></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Etymology\">Etymology</h3></div>\n<ul class=\"etymid\" id=\"Vietnamese:&#95;學生\" data-lang=\"vi\" data-id=\"學生\"></ul><p><a href=\"/wiki/Sino-Vietnamese\" title=\"Sino-Vietnamese\">Sino-Vietnamese</a>&#32;word from <i class=\"Hani mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AD%B8%E7%94%9F#Vietnamese\" title=\"學生\">學生</a></i>, composed of&#32;<i class=\"Hani mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AD%B8#Vietnamese\" title=\"學\">學</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">to learn</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>&#32;and&#32;<i class=\"Hani mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%94%9F#Vietnamese\" title=\"生\">生</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">learned person; student</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>, from <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_language\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Chinese language\">Chinese</a></span> <i class=\"Hant mention\" lang=\"zh\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AD%B8%E7%94%9F#Chinese\" title=\"學生\">學生</a></i><span class=\"Zsym mention\" style=\"font-size:100%;\">&#160;/ </span><i class=\"Hans mention\" lang=\"zh\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AD%A6%E7%94%9F#Chinese\" title=\"学生\">学生</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">student</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>. Compare <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japanese_language\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Japanese language\">Japanese</a></span> <i class=\"Jpan mention\" lang=\"ja\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AD%A6%E7%94%9F#Japanese\" title=\"学生\">学生</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-tr tr\">gakusei</span>, <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">student</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span> and <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Korean_language\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Korean language\">Korean</a></span> <i class=\"Kore mention\" lang=\"ko\"><a href=\"/wiki/%ED%95%99%EC%83%9D#Korean\" title=\"학생\">학생</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span lang=\"ko-Latn\" class=\"mention-tr tr Latn\">haksaeng</span>, <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">student</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>. These cognates apply to students of all kinds, while this Vietnamese false friend only applies to primary and secondary pupils in modern times; the general word is <a href=\"/wiki/sinh_vi%C3%AAn\" title=\"sinh viên\">sinh viên</a>.\n</p><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Pronunciation\">Pronunciation</h3></div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\"><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hanoi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Hanoi\">Hà Nội</a></span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:International_Phonetic_Alphabet\" title=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Vietnamese_pronunciation\" title=\"Appendix:Vietnamese pronunciation\">key</a>)</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[hawk͡p̚˧˨ʔ sïŋ˧˧]</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\"><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hu%E1%BA%BF\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Huế\">Huế</a></span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:International_Phonetic_Alphabet\" title=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Vietnamese_pronunciation\" title=\"Appendix:Vietnamese pronunciation\">key</a>)</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[hawk͡p̚˨˩ʔ ʂɨn˧˧]</span> ~ <span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[hawk͡p̚˨˩ʔ sɨn˧˧]</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\"><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saigon\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Saigon\">Saigon</a></span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:International_Phonetic_Alphabet\" title=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Vietnamese_pronunciation\" title=\"Appendix:Vietnamese pronunciation\">key</a>)</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[hawk͡p̚˨˩˨ ʂɨn˧˧]</span> ~ <span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[hawk͡p̚˨˩˨ sɨn˧˧]</span></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Noun\">Noun</h3></div>\n<p><span class=\"headword-line\"><strong class=\"Latn headword\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/h%E1%BB%8Dc#Vietnamese\" title=\"học\">học</a> <a href=\"/wiki/sinh#Vietnamese\" title=\"sinh\">sinh</a></strong></span> \n</p>\n<ol><li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\"><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content label-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#archaic\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">archaic</a><span class=\"ib-comma label-comma\">,</span>&#32;<a href=\"/wiki/education\" title=\"education\">education</a></span><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">)</span></span> a <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/student#English\" title=\"student\">student</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\"><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content label-content\">primary&#32;and&#32;secondary&#32;<a href=\"/wiki/education\" title=\"education\">education</a></span><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">)</span></span> a <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/pupil#English\" title=\"pupil\">pupil</a>&#59; a <a href=\"/wiki/schoolchild#English\" title=\"schoolchild\">schoolchild</a>&#47;<a href=\"/wiki/schoolkid#English\" title=\"schoolkid\">schoolkid</a></span>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"nyms hypernym\"><span style=\"font-size: smaller\">Hypernym:</span> <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/h%E1%BB%8Dc_tr%C3%B2#Vietnamese\" title=\"học trò\">học trò</a></span></span></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"nyms coordinate-term\"><span style=\"font-size: smaller\">Coordinate terms:</span> <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/h%E1%BB%8Dc_vi%C3%AAn#Vietnamese\" title=\"học viên\">học viên</a></span>, <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/sinh_vi%C3%AAn#Vietnamese\" title=\"sinh viên\">sinh viên</a></span>, <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/nghi%C3%AAn_c%E1%BB%A9u_sinh#Vietnamese\" title=\"nghiên cứu sinh\">nghiên cứu sinh</a></span></span></dd></dl></li></ol></div>",
    "wikitext": "==Vietnamese==\n\n===Etymology===\n{{vi-etym-sino|學|to learn|生|learned person; student}}, from {{der|vi|zh|學生||student}}. Compare {{cog|ja|学生|tr=gakusei||student}} and {{cog|ko|학생||student}}. These cognates apply to students of all kinds, while this Vietnamese false friend only applies to primary and secondary pupils in modern times; the general word is [[sinh viên]].\n\n===Pronunciation===\n{{vi-IPA}}\n\n===Noun===\n{{vi-noun}}\n\n# {{lb|vi|archaic|education}} a {{l|en|student}}\n# {{lb|vi|primary|and|secondary|_|education}} a {{l|en|[[pupil]]; a [[schoolchild]]/[[schoolkid]]}}\n#: {{hyper|vi|học trò}}\n#: {{cot|vi|học viên|sinh viên|nghiên cứu sinh}}\n\n{{C|vi|Children}}"
  }
}
